  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a20105d88834d764380d6090e8c10179, type: 3}
  m_Name: Refinery Research Notes
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  title: Refinery Research Notes
  content: "Research Division \u2014 Internal Notes\nThe crystalline deposits forming
    inside the machinery appear to strengthen structural components rather than weaken
    them.\nInitial tests show reduced vibration and improved pressure stability when
    properly installed.\nHowever, crystal growth accelerates in areas with higher
    Overflow concentrations.\nContinued reliance on these formations may ultimately
    worsen the contamination they help contain."
